---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How this static website handles your visit."
>
  <section class="shell page-intro">
    <span class="eyebrow">The details</span>
    <h1>
      Privacy<span class="accent-dot">.</span>
    </h1>
  </section>
  <div class="shell narrow prose legal">
    <p>
      This website is a static journal hosted on GitHub Pages. It has no account
      system, advertising, analytics scripts, contact forms or newsletter
      tracking.
    </p>
    <h2>What your browser loads</h2>
    <p>
      Pages, styles, images and fonts are served with the website. Fonts are
      hosted locally. The site does not set cookies or use browser storage.
    </p>
    <h2>Search and subscriptions</h2>
    <p>
      The writing archive filters titles and summaries in your browser. Search
      terms are not sent to a server. The RSS feed is a public file that you can
      subscribe to using your own reader.
    </p>
    <h2>Hosting and external links</h2>
    <p>
      GitHub processes technical request information as the hosting provider.
      External links take you to other services with their own privacy
      practices. See{' '}
      <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">
        GitHub's privacy statement
      </a>
      .
    </p>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
